51
00:01:42,270 --> 00:01:43,670
And as soon as they hit an ad like that,

52
00:01:43,710 --> 00:01:45,070
they just kind of scroll on.

53
00:01:45,250 --> 00:01:47,430
When your ad's emotional temperature

54
00:01:47,430 --> 00:01:50,250
doesn't align with the moment

55
00:01:50,250 --> 00:01:51,910
that your customer is currently in

56
00:01:51,910 --> 00:01:54,030
or how they're feeling about their problem,

57
00:01:54,030 --> 00:01:56,330
everything, even great offers

58
00:01:56,330 --> 00:01:57,770
are going to fall completely flat, right?

59
00:01:57,890 --> 00:01:59,190
This is why it's kind of critical

60
00:01:59,190 --> 00:02:00,890
to get this step correct.

61
00:02:01,570 --> 00:02:03,750
Most marketers are going to optimize words.

62
00:02:03,930 --> 00:02:05,850
They're going to optimize the copy itself,

63
00:02:05,850 --> 00:02:08,770
but the winners are going to optimize for feel.

64
00:02:09,230 --> 00:02:11,190
So next, I'm going to show you

65
00:02:11,190 --> 00:02:12,690
how to take your ad from something

66
00:02:12,690 --> 00:02:14,230
