67
00:02:14,330 --> 00:02:16,070
something that should be converting but isn't,

68
00:02:16,350 --> 00:02:19,170
to an ad that is spot on emotionally

69
00:02:19,170 --> 00:02:20,650
with where your customers sit

70
00:02:20,650 --> 00:02:22,270
inside their subconscious mind

71
00:02:22,270 --> 00:02:24,090
so that you can generate better results

72
00:02:24,090 --> 00:02:25,330
on your next test.

73
00:02:25,470 --> 00:02:26,790
